1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:05,913
Meet Ghost Call. An AI assistant that helps you on your calls, in real time.

2
00:00:06,213 --> 00:00:10,539
You make the call. Hermes listens, and hints only to you.

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:26,289
Hermes hears every word. A hint appears, and only you can see it.

4
00:00:30,893 --> 00:00:34,459
It knows your target price, and never says it out loud.

5
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:48,609
Sixty, no contract. Hermes has a follow-up. One tap, and it plays in your ear. They never hear it.

6
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:12,674
Hang up, and get the deal, what's still open, and a message to confirm it.

7
00:01:12,973 --> 00:01:17,337
Two browser links, a real phone line, or any call on speaker.

8
00:01:17,637 --> 00:01:22,025
Ghost Call. Your real-time AI copilot for every call.
